## Loading screens
menu-loading-title = Loading OpenCity
menu-loading-tip-count = Tip { $n } of { $total }
menu-loading-tips = Press R to build roads and Z to paint zones next to them. | Zoned lots only grow when they have a road, power and water. | Press Space to pause the simulation and 1, 2 or 3 to change its speed. | Open the budget with F to adjust taxes before the city runs out of money. | Press I to open the info views, and Shift+I to step through them. | Press B to bulldoze a building or a piece of road. | Press G to open the statistics and see how your city develops over time. | Power plants and water towers serve a limited area: place them near the buildings that need them. | Parks and plazas raise land value and make citizens happier. | Watch the demand bars: they show which kind of zone your city needs next.

